  "text": "G\n·\nGenesys AQM\nQUALITY INTELLIGENCE\nMONITOR\n◌\nOverview\nQUALITY\n◷\nEvaluations\n▥\nAnalytics\n◎\nCalibration\nCONFIGURATION\n◇\nPolicies\n▤\nEvaluation Forms\n▦\nQuestion Groups\n⚙\nSettings\nINTERACTIONS\n☷\nConversations\n◈\nConversation review\n✦\nPowered by Jev\n\nTyped AI decisions, shaped into clear quality signals.\n\nV0.17 OPERATIONAL OVERVIEW • 2026\nWorkspace / Forms\nADMIN\nJev managed securely by automation service\nCONFIGURATION\nEvaluation Forms\n\nPolicies pin published versions. Drafts can be tested without entering production analytics.\n\nTable\nCards\nImport form\n＋ New form\nStatus\nAll statuses\nDraft\nTesting\nPublished\nRetired\nVersion\nAll versions\nLatest version per family\nUsage\nAll usage\nAssigned to policy\nUnassigned\nSearch\n6 results\nForm name ↓\n\t\nStatus\n\t\nVersion\n\t\nQuestions\n\t\nAssigned policies\n\t\nServer evaluations\n\t\nServer avg score\n\t\nLast modified\n\nSales / Service Quality\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nRetention / Cancellation\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nGeneral Customer Service\tPUBLISHED\tv17\t3\t5\t8\t66%\t—\nCustomer Service - AI Scoring\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t9\t0\t0\t—\t—\nCompliance & Identity Verification\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t2\t0\t—\t—\nComplaints Handling\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nPUBLISHED · VERSION 1\nSales / Service Quality\nExport JSON\nDuplicate as new form\nTEST FORM\nEdit as new version\nRetire\n\nThis version's question and scoring definition is locked. Historical evaluations retain its snapshot.\n\nForm name\nDescription\nPass score\n75%\nCritical questions\nNeeds discovery\nRelevant recommendation\nClear terms\nCustomer agency\nNext steps\nQuestion groups\n\nQuestion weights determine the overall score. Read-only published definition.\n\nAdd group\nAdd reusable group\nOverall scoring\nQuestion weighted\nGroup weighted\n\nQuestion weighted combines applicable question credits. Group weighted combines group scores using their relative weights; configure a weight for every scoring group.\n\nYes threshold70%\nGeneral\n↑\n↓\nDuplicate group\nDelete group\nGroup name\nGroup description\nGroup scoring\nUse group scoring settings\n01\nNeeds discovery\nOrdered score\n\nHow well did the agent understand the customer’s needs before recommending a product?\n\nWeight 1.5 · Enabled · ID needs_discovery\n\nPoor (poor · credit 0)\nAbsent or counterproductive.\nLimited (limited · credit 0.33)\nPartial with material gaps.\nGood (good · credit 0.67)\nEffective with minor gaps.\nExcellent (excellent · credit 1)\nConsistently effective.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n02\nRelevant recommendation\nYes / No\n\nWas the recommendation linked to the needs the customer expressed?\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID relevant_recommendation\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n03\nClear terms\nYes / No\n\nWere price, limitations and important terms clearly disclosed?\n\nWeight 2 · Enabled · ID terms_clear\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n04\nCustomer agency\nOrdered score\n\nHow well did the agent give the customer space to decide without pressure?\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID customer_agency\n\nPoor (poor · credit 0)\nAbsent or counterproductive.\nLimited (limited · credit 0.33)\nPartial with material gaps.\nGood (good · credit 0.67)\nEffective with minor gaps.\nExcellent (excellent · credit 1)\nConsistently effective.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n05\nNext steps\nYes / No\n\nWere purchase or follow-up steps made clear?\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID sales_next_steps\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\nAdd question\nView history\nISOLATED SANDBOX\nTest form\n\nTry this exact form draft on a small sample. Test results are isolated from production quality, coverage, and monitoring.\n\nExecution\nLegacy browser sandbox (development)\nDurable server sandbox (recommended)\nSource\nSynthetic\nGenesys Cloud\nSelection\nMost recent\nDeterministic random\nManual selection\nConversations\n\n5 conversations · 5 questions · 1 form · 5 evaluation assignments · up to 5 Jev requests\n\nThe server uses its configured Jev credential and keeps isolated durable test history. Jev receives applicable questions in batches, one request per dependency wave. Skipped questions incur no request. Maximum sample size: 20.\n\nTest formRefresh test history",
